    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Miene} by the water, which will start a cut-scene revealing a burglary in process.
* Talk to {n:Altiret}, who asks you to retreive the stolen item.
* Talk to Miene to obtain a clue, an {@i:Eagle Button|578} {i:Eagle Button|Eagle Button|578}.
** **(Optional)** You can attempt to trade the button to Altiret.
* **(Optional)** Several guard and bystander NPCs will have comments about the thief:
** Port San d'Oria:
*** {n:Eaugouint}, {n:Artinien}, {n:Brifalien} in the immediate area.
*** {n:Meuxtajean}, {n:Coribalgeant}, {n:Noquerelle}, {n:Answald} near the mog house entrance.
*** {n:Comittie}, {n:Meinemelle}, {n:Maunadolace}, {n:Sheridan}, {n:Parcarin}, {n:Solgierte} near the auction house.
*** {n:Laucimercen}, {n:Marquie} in the corridors to the west.
** Northern San d'Oria:
*** {n:Aurege}, {n:Guilberdrier} near the carpenters' guild.
** For just the ones that give hints:
*** Port San d'Oria: {n:Crilde}, {n:Rielle}, {n:Avandale}
*** Northern San d'Oria: {n:Pepigort}, {n:Maurinne}, {n:Gilipese}, {n:Rodaillece}

* Head out to {z:West Ronfaure} and look for {n:Esca} inside a tower at (F-6). She will demand evidence.
* Trade the button to her, prompting her to admit she was the thief.
* After receiving the {@i:Gilt Glasses|579} {i:Gilt Glasses|Gilt Glasses|579}, return them to Altiret for your reward.

